OL,3,GNEWSABorges and Me: New film tells
OL,4,Astory of writer's 1970s tour of
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FJay Parini was a student at the
OL,8,FUniversity of St Andrews in 1971 when
OL,9,Fhe found himself escorting the blind
OL,10,FArgentinian writer Jorge Luis Borges on
OL,11,Fa road trip around Scotland.
OL,13,FBorges (1899`1986) was a short-story
OL,14,Fwriter, essayist, and poet, considered
OL,15,Fone of the most significant writers of
OL,16,Fthe 20th Century.
OL,18,FEducated in Europe, he became a
OL,19,Fprofessor in Buenos Aires and in 1955
OL,20,Fwas appointed director of the country's
OL,21,Fnational library.
